Dive Bar is a drinking house in one of the rough stretches of [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]], where the bars stand shoulder to shoulder and the streets belong to them. Its sign turns in the air above the door: holographic text reading Dive Bar over a little icon of a splash of water, as though somebody had just gone in.

The inside is dark and seedy at any hour, the lights dim, flickering, or on their way out, the booths and stools worn down to exposed cushion and flaking plastic. It stays packed with people too drunk for the time of day.
